    {
      "id": "claim_ca1298f17935442b91ed648b82a3ced7",
      "statement": "The foreground probe in the usage collector resolves only the owning process's image path (GetForegroundWindow -> GetWindowThreadProcessId -> OpenProcess(PROCESS_QUERY_LIMITED_INFORMATION) -> QueryFullProcessImageNameW) and never calls GetWindowText, so window title text is never obtained at collection time rather than obtained and filtered out.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://usage_log.py#L1-L9",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1dc2bfcae92ddb5c06f7b5bc38374f37a1731db0a7059f9c78d3927992627a4d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://usage_log.py#L80-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0c06cec1a3241b9094291a34653e1c921fa3388df3f2c2990b33f4b33d2711f5:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1f6005f49f2343b4be87478e3132e806",
      "statement": "A standing unit test (PrivacyGuardTest) walks every top-level *.py module in the repository root and fails if any contains the strings GetWindowText, window_title or WindowTitle; the scan is non-recursive, so modules under scripts/ or tests/ are not covered by it.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/test_usage_log.py#L105-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:37c277c8a59e2060ff8425432e3c81728500e8f20fd3eaa26da259ab4624f72b:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_162e5cc8fef44520b1c0b86010b4bfbe",
      "statement": "ADR-0002 records two rejected alternatives to keeping titles out of the usage log - storing titles locally only (a plaintext log file is itself the boundary) and storing sanitized titles (sanitization rules cannot enumerate the shapes of case numbers and party names, and titles contribute nothing to judging which application is used most) - because the user's daily work is legal case research where titles carry case numbers, party names and project names; neither alternative may be re-proposed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/adr/0002-no-window-titles-in-usage-log.md#L3-L3",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:68fd2d516a89d81eef9d61f1ad660aa256915ed86b4afe84d9f56edc0386d67a:"
        },
        {
