      "id": "claim_d53eb7f2820e4d509c815a284b8b11db",
      "statement": "Access to the upstream AI-tool SQLite stores is read-only by construction: _open_ro connects with the URI file:{db_path}?mode=ro and uri=True plus a deliberately short timeout=0.5, and collect_sessions wraps each scanner so that a failed tool only prints one line and is skipped instead of degrading the HTTP contract.",
