      "id": "claim_7325ae56bd2449c4af0b993897c00492",
      "statement": "The session scanners never read title-bearing columns: the hermes sessions query selects id, cwd, last_activity_at, started_at, end_reason and archived but not title, the zcode query selects id, directory, time_updated and time_archived but not title, and kimi work rows are title-less by design because the conversation body is locked in an upstream private store.",
