    {
      "id": "claim_861f226113c444aa9526fa7ef81ffd38",
      "statement": "The data service defines only do_GET, serves two read-only routes from a hard-coded loopback host with no authentication and a wildcard Access-Control-Allow-Origin header, and ADR-0001 records that this posture is acceptable precisely because arranging icons through Win32 messages removes the need for any write endpoint; adding a mutating route would contradict that ADR and requires a new one.",
