      "id": "claim_bd31a78fb7d846e08a5faefe7efc7b89",
      "statement": "Icon coordinates are the only thing this project writes to the desktop - snapshots and restores read and write (x, y) pairs keyed by display name and never move, rename or delete a disk file - while archiving documents into a subfolder was explicitly rejected because it would break hard-coded absolute paths, cloud synchronisation and user muscle memory, and would be irreversible.",
