    {
      "id": "claim_40fa8e58ff664fd28c50bd8877682d77",
      "statement": "Arrangement reaches the public desktop as well as the user's own: desktop_dirs() returns both CSIDL_DESKTOP and CSIDL_COMMON_DESKTOP, and positions are stored by display name without recording which folder an item came from, so arranging .lnk files under C:\\Users\\Public\\Desktop takes effect for every user of the machine - an accepted consequence recorded in ADR-0001.",
